---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Mahindra Rivenza Launch Price, Carpet Area & Typology Breakdown: Complete 2026 Evaluation",
  "description": "Comprehensive buyer breakdown of Mahindra Rivenza launch pricing starting ₹90 Lakhs*, carpet areas (635 - 1,465 sq.ft), aggregate usable areas, and ~44,000 sq.ft clubhouse specifications.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "West Pune Real Estate Intelligence"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Mahindra Lifespaces Homes Research Desk"
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-10-06",
  "dateModified": "2026-10-07"
};
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Rivenza Launch Price & Carpet Area Analysis 2026 | Baner Annex Mahalunge"
  description="Exhaustive financial & spatial guide to Mahindra Rivenza: starting price ₹90 Lakhs*, 635 to 1,465 sq.ft carpet areas, 9 typologies, and cost sheet breakdown for Baner Annex, Mahalunge."
  keywords="mahindra rivenza launch price, mahindra rivenza carpet area, mahindra rivenza price list, mahindra rivenza cost sheet, mahindra rivenza floor plan sizes, mahindra rivenza 2 bhk price, mahindra rivenza 3 bhk price, mahindra rivenza 4 bhk price"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-launch-price-carpet-area-analysis-2026/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Article Header -->
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Launch Analysis</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>October 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Mahindra Rivenza Launch Price, Carpet Area & Typology Breakdown: The Definitive Buyer's Dossier
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          The official market introduction of Mahindra Rivenza across 13.46 acres in Baner Annex / Mahalunge establishes a new benchmark for West Pune. Here is the verified analysis of configurations, carpet areas, launch rates, and cost sheet parameters.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Image -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl">
        <img
          src="https://cms.mahindralifespaces.com/web/sites/default/files/styles/web_banner_webp/public/2026-10/jpeg-optimizer_Elevation%20Opt%20A..webp"
          alt="Mahindra Rivenza Baner Annex Mahalunge Architecture Elevation"
          class="w-full h-80 sm:h-96 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-900 text-[11px] text-stone-400 text-center">
          Official elevation render of Mahindra Rivenza high-rise towers in Baner Annex, Mahalunge, Pune.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Insights Box -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-gold-400">Executive Summary for Homebuyers</h3>
        <ul class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><strong>Starting Price:</strong> From ₹90 Lakhs* for 2 BHK Premium residences.</li>
          <li><strong>Carpet Area Range:</strong> 635 sq.ft to 1,465 sq.ft RERA carpet (688 to 1,651 sq.ft aggregate area).</li>
          <li><strong>MahaRERA Registration:</strong> Phase 1 (PR1261012602102) & Phase 2 (PM1261012602103).</li>
          <li><strong>Amenities:</strong> Over 2.65 Lakh sq.ft amenity footprint including ~44,000 sq.ft clubhouse with sunken aqua bar pool.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Content -->
      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-300 font-light">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-100 pt-4">1. Typology & Price Matrix</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike conventional high-density developments in Hinjewadi or Wakad, Mahindra Rivenza offers 9 distinct typologies categorized into 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK layouts. Each residence incorporates biophilic architectural principles with dedicated Enclosed Balcony / Verandah / Terrace (EBVT) zones that maximize natural daylight and wind circulation.
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-charcoal-900 my-6">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-charcoal-950 text-gold-400 border-b border-white/10">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3.5 font-semibold">Typology</th>
                <th class="p-3.5 font-semibold">RERA Carpet</th>
                <th class="p-3.5 font-semibold">Aggregate Area</th>
                <th class="p-3.5 font-semibold">Launch Rate</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">2 BHK Premium</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">635 sq.ft (59.03 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">688 sq.ft (63.91 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹90 Lakhs* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">2 BHK Luxury B</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">705 sq.ft (65.50 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">785 sq.ft (72.92 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹1.04 Cr* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">2 BHK Luxury A</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">711 sq.ft (66.04 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">824 sq.ft (76.52 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹1.14 Cr* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">3 BHK Deluxe C</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">882 sq.ft (81.92 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">995 sq.ft (92.40 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹1.31 Cr* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">3 BHK Ultra Luxury B</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">1,065 sq.ft (98.94 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">1,206 sq.ft (112.08 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹1.60 Cr* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">4 BHK Luxury B</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">1,438 sq.ft (133.61 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">1,615 sq.ft (150.07 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹2.20 Cr* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-stone-100 font-medium">4 BHK Luxury A</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">1,465 sq.ft (136.09 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">1,651 sq.ft (153.33 sq.m)</td>
                <td class="p-3.5 text-gold-400 font-semibold">₹2.55 Cr* Onwards</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-100 pt-4">2. The 13.46-Acre Low-Density Advantage</h2>
        <p>
          While adjacent projects in Mahalunge pack up to 350-400 units per acre, Mahindra Rivenza dedicates over 9 acres of its 13.46-acre land parcel to open bio-reserves, landscaped wellness lawns, and vehicle-free recreational zones. This ensures high cross-ventilation, scenic hill horizons, and sustained capital appreciation over the project lifecycle.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-100 pt-4">3. Bank Approvals & Financial Flexibility</h2>
        <p>
          Nationalized and premier private lending institutions including State Bank of India (SBI), HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, and Canara Bank have sanctioned APF approvals for Mahindra Rivenza. Construction-linked payment milestones (CLP) aligned with MahaRERA guidelines protect buyer capital through each slab casting phase.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Footer -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-100">Request Official Cost Sheet & Availability</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto font-light">
          Get transparent, all-inclusive pricing breakdown with stamp duty, registration, GST, and floor-wise premium options.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
          <a href="/pricing/" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-gold-400 transition-colors">
            View Complete Pricing Guide
          </a>
          <button data-open-modal class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-stone-200 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors">
            Inquire via Sales Desk
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
